{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-snapping","title":"网格与吸附：把鼠标坐标折算成合法落点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/placement/grid-snapping","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格与吸附-把鼠标坐标折算成合法落点\">网格与吸附：把鼠标坐标折算成合法落点</h1><p>玩家在《英灵神殿》里举着一面墙，鼠标扫过地基边缘，墙「啪」地贴上去、角度自动对齐——这零点几秒里，系统做了两件事：把连续的鼠标射线命中点量化到一个离散落点，再把新部件的吸附点和目标的吸附点配对。这一篇讲这两件事的数学与算法。它承接 <a href=\"../foundations/building-model\">数据模型</a> 定义的吸附点结构，只处理「量化 + 匹配」；自由摆放和重叠检测在 <a href=\"free-placement\">自由放置与碰撞</a>，是否允许落下则在 <a href=\"validity-rules\">合法性规则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>放置的本质是把「玩家的连续意图」转换为「系统的一个离散合法落点」。两种范式拆解这一步的方式不同，但都归结为两个子操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子操作</th>\n<th>网格范式</th>\n<th>吸附范式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定位</td>\n<td>量化到全局格点</td>\n<td>匹配内容定义的吸附点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向</td>\n<td>朝向取整到离散档</td>\n<td>由吸附点的相对朝向解出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网格范式用一把全局尺子完成定位与定向，吸附范式则把这两个问题外包给内容作者预定义的吸附点布局。前者把自由度锁在格子粒度上，后者把自由度交给部件设计——这就是同一件事（把意图折算成落点）在两套范式下的全部差别。本篇余下部分分别展开这两个子操作，并说明落点选定后必须立刻做的占用查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网格量化-连续到离散\">网格量化：连续到离散</h2><p>网格范式最基础的操作是把世界坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 折算到最近的格点。设格边长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，量化就是逐分量取整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mtext>snap</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i = \\operatorname{round}\\!\\left(\\frac{p_i}{s}\\right), \\qquad \\mathbf{p}_{\\text{snap}} = s \\cdot \\mathbf{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>round</code> 意味着以格中心为界四舍五入；若希望部件对齐格角而非格心，改成 <code>floor</code>。对于占多格的部件（比如 2×1 的地基），要把部件的<strong>参考点</strong>（通常是包围盒某个角或中心）对齐，再按占地展开——否则偶数尺寸的部件会半格错位。一个常见陷阱是浮点累积误差：连续放置几百块后，如果每次都基于上一块的浮点位置推算，误差会累积到肉眼可见的错缝。解决办法是始终存储整数格坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，世界坐标每次由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 现算，绝不反过来。</p>\n<p>朝向同样要量化。二维平面上朝向落到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>270</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{0°,90°,180°,270°\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0°</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">270°</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>raw</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 90° \\cdot \\operatorname{round}(\\theta_{\\text{raw}}/90°)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">raw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/90°</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；三维则是 24 个轴对齐旋转里选最近的一个。把朝向也存成小枚举，序列化和网络同步都受益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吸附点匹配-内容定义的落点\">吸附点匹配：内容定义的落点</h2><p>吸附范式不依赖全局网格，落点由已放置部件的吸附点提供。放置流程是一个「搜索候选 → 打分 → 选最优 → 对齐」的管线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[鼠标射线命中世界] --&gt; B[在命中点附近半径 r&lt;br/&gt;空间查询已放置部件]&#10;  B --&gt; C[收集这些部件的空闲吸附点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按类型兼容过滤&lt;br/&gt;accepts 兼容表]&#10;  D --&gt; E[对每个候选吸附点打分&lt;br/&gt;距离+朝向对齐度]&#10;  E --&gt; F{有得分超阈值的?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[对齐:解出让本部件吸附点&lt;br/&gt;与目标重合的变换]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[回退自由放置或标记非法]\">graph TD\n  A[鼠标射线命中世界] --&gt; B[在命中点附近半径 r&lt;br/&gt;空间查询已放置部件]\n  B --&gt; C[收集这些部件的空闲吸附点]\n  C --&gt; D[按类型兼容过滤&lt;br/&gt;accepts 兼容表]\n  D --&gt; E[对每个候选吸附点打分&lt;br/&gt;距离+朝向对齐度]\n  E --&gt; F{有得分超阈值的?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[对齐:解出让本部件吸附点&lt;br/&gt;与目标重合的变换]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[回退自由放置或标记非法]</pre><p><strong>候选搜索</strong>用空间哈希或八叉树，把附近部件的空闲吸附点收上来，规模通常几个到几十个。<strong>兼容过滤</strong>用原型里的 <code>type</code> + <code>accepts</code> 兼容表——墙的 <code>bottom</code> 只接地基的 <code>top</code>，屋顶的 <code>edge</code> 只接墙的 <code>top</code>，非法组合直接淘汰。<strong>打分</strong>综合两项：候选吸附点到鼠标命中点的距离、以及朝向对齐的代价，越近越对齐得分越高。选出最高分后，<strong>对齐</strong>是解一个刚体变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，使本部件的吸附点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 精确落到目标吸附点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>π</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_{s_b} \\cdot R_{\\pi} \\cdot T_{s_a}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9392em;vertical-align:-0.2559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2112em;vertical-align:-0.3471em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3471em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{s_a}, T_{s_b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9392em;vertical-align:-0.2559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个吸附点各自的世界变换，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>π</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是让两个吸附点朝向相对（法线相向）的旋转。对齐完成后，把双方 <code>occupiedBy</code> 互填，一条连接图的边就此建立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种范式的取舍对照\">两种范式的取舍对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>网格量化</th>\n<th>吸附点匹配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>落点来源</td>\n<td>全局格点</td>\n<td>已放置部件的吸附点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心运算</td>\n<td>除法取整</td>\n<td>空间查询+兼容过滤+打分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，k=附近吸附点数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力</td>\n<td>受全局网格限制</td>\n<td>由内容布局决定，更灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接关系</td>\n<td>相邻隐式成边</td>\n<td>匹配即显式成边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型陷阱</td>\n<td>浮点累积、偶数尺寸错位</td>\n<td>候选过多导致抖动、误吸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网格的陷阱在数值，吸附的陷阱在体验——候选太多会让预览在多个吸附点间反复跳变（抖动），常见对策是加入<strong>滞回</strong>（hysteresis）：当前选中的吸附点享受得分加成，只有明显更优的候选才能夺走焦点，避免鼠标微动就跳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旋转-镜像与多格对齐\">旋转、镜像与多格对齐</h2><p>实战里玩家还要手动旋转（滚轮）、镜像（造对称结构）、以及沿吸附点法线翻转。这些操作都应作用在<strong>量化后的离散状态</strong>上：滚轮一次转一个朝向档，而不是连续角度；镜像是对占地矩阵取反后重新对齐吸附点。多格部件对齐吸附点时，要保证它的<strong>每一个</strong>吸附点和相邻部件都对得上，否则会出现「一个角吸住、其余悬空」的假连接——这类假连接会让 <a href=\"../structure/connectivity-graph\">连接图</a> 误判连通、让 <a href=\"structural-integrity\">结构稳定性</a> 算错支撑。稳妥做法是对齐后做一次全吸附点校验，只有全部对齐才承认放置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与占用查询的配合\">与占用查询的配合</h2><p>无论哪种范式，量化/匹配出落点后，都要问「这个位置被占了吗」。网格范式的占用查询极便宜：用格坐标作键查一张哈希表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。吸附范式则查目标吸附点是否已被 <code>occupiedBy</code> 占用。这一步是放置合法性的第一关，把空间冲突挡在规则引擎之前，详见 <a href=\"validity-rules\">合法性规则</a> 如何把它和资源、权限、区域等其它约束串成一条校验链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网格量化是逐分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i=\\operatorname{round}(p_i/s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，始终存整数格坐标、世界坐标现算，避免浮点累积与偶数尺寸错位。</li>\n<li>吸附匹配是「空间查询候选 → 兼容表过滤 → 距离+朝向打分 → 解变换对齐 → 互填 occupiedBy」的管线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>网格陷阱在数值，吸附陷阱在体验（抖动/误吸），滞回打分是常用对策。</li>\n<li>多格部件必须全吸附点校验，否则假连接会污染连接图与稳定性判定。</li>\n<li>量化/匹配出落点后立即做占用查询，作为合法性校验链的第一关。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上游数据：<a href=\"../foundations/building-model\">数据模型</a>；下游校验：<a href=\"validity-rules\">合法性规则</a></li>\n<li>落点连成边之后：<a href=\"../structure/connectivity-graph\">连接图</a></li>\n<li>跨库——空间查询用的包围盒与加速结构，见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/bounding-volumes\">游戏物理·包围体</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格与吸附：把鼠标坐标折算成合法落点","id":"网格与吸附-把鼠标坐标折算成合法落点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网格量化：连续到离散","id":"网格量化-连续到离散"},{"level":2,"text":"吸附点匹配：内容定义的落点","id":"吸附点匹配-内容定义的落点"},{"level":2,"text":"两种范式的取舍对照","id":"两种范式的取舍对照"},{"level":2,"text":"旋转、镜像与多格对齐","id":"旋转-镜像与多格对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"与占用查询的配合","id":"与占用查询的配合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"数据模型：一个部件在内存里长什么样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/foundations/building-model"},"next":{"title":"自由放置与碰撞：没有网格时如何不穿模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-building-construction-systems/placement/free-placement"}}